title Home Assistant 0.3.0: the owner-shaped stored dashboard (one masonry view of 12 cards: 9 entities, 2 sensor, 1 weather-forecast, invented names), its view's tab first, then Favourites, the areas, All; dragged down to the end
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO dash

wait 1800
shot dash-top
check dash-top
expect text "Online"
expect text "Home"
expect text "Favourites"
expect text "Living room"
@640x480,800x480,1024x600,1280x720,1280x800,720x720,480x800,480x640,800x1280 expect text "Lamp"
drag 0.5 0.85 0.5 0.55
wait 500
shot dash-1
check dash-1
drag 0.5 0.85 0.5 0.55
wait 500
shot dash-2
check dash-2
drag 0.5 0.85 0.5 0.55
wait 500
shot dash-3
check dash-3
drag 0.5 0.85 0.5 0.55
wait 500
shot dash-4
check dash-4
drag 0.5 0.85 0.5 0.55
wait 500
shot dash-5
check dash-5
drag 0.5 0.85 0.5 0.55
wait 500
shot dash-6
check dash-6
# the end of the view: End moves the keyboard's focus to the last row (the first key only shows the focus)
key end
key end
wait 500
shot dash-end
check dash-end
expect text "Motion sensor battery"
expect noquit
